*.jpg
*.jfif
*.FCbak
DemoProgram.txt

# Exception: the ODrive S1 J11 pinout is a wiring reference cited by
# PIN_MAP.md, claude.md and README.md. It must travel with the repo.
!SpincoaterPinMap.jfif

# SolidWorks lock files, present while a part is open
~$*

# Slicer print files (3MF); the SLDPRT and STEP are the sources
*.3mf

# Mesh exports for printing (STL); the SLDPRT and STEP are the sources
*.[sS][tT][lL]

# Raw 3D scans (scanner projects, meshes, point clouds; hundreds of MB). The dimensions taken
# from them live in tools/draw_wiring.py and the models built from those under CAD/ (issue #219).
CAD/DisplayScan/
